  "details": "Most loading screens are effected by the UI Menu slider, Feel The Drop seems to not be. It's also SUPER loud.\n\nRepro:\n\n1. Turn UI Menu volume to 0%\n\n2. Equip \"Feel The Drop\" loading screen.\n\n3. Swap to a world you don't already have cached\n\n4. Feel The Drop in your eardrums as they burst ;(\n\nUnsure if this may be related to the issue where feel the drop plays multiple times: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/unity-6-1882-feel-the-drop-loading-screen-sometimes-plays-bgm-twice\n\nHowever, even if it was playing 4x stacked or something, 4 x 0 should still be no audio.",
